					</p>
					<div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
						<a
							href="/bot"
							class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-bold text-sm sm:text-base rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20"
						>
